# Runnable before done

After writing or changing code, do **not** mark the task complete until it actually runs:

1. Build/start the affected app (backend, frontend, or both).
2. Hit the affected API or open the affected screen and confirm it works.
3. Run related automated tests when applicable.
4. Never claim “done” from code edits alone — show evidence it runs (command output, HTTP 200, UI without error).

If it does not run: report the error and next fix — do not mark complete.
